{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55532","headline":"临灭偈（题拟） · 契此","name":"临灭偈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弥勒真弥勒，分（《布袋和尚传》作「化」）身千百亿。\n时时示时（《布袋和尚传》作「世」、《鸡肋编》卷中作「识世」）人，时人终（《鸡肋编》作「总」、《五灯会元》作「自」、《布袋和尚传》作「俱」）不识。\n（以上诸首均见《景德传灯录》卷二十七、《五灯会元》卷二、《卍续藏》本《明州定应大师布袋和尚传》〖元人昙噩作〗。\n）（按：《布袋和尚传》云此爲其灭後作，末题九字云：「不得状吾相，此即是真。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"契此","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55532.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55532","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}